# The image only needs the web application. Everything else in the repository
# (documents, the pitch video, the Chrome extension, data files) stays out of the build.
*
!Deployable Website Application

Deployable Website Application/node_modules
Deployable Website Application/apps/*/node_modules
Deployable Website Application/packages/*/node_modules
Deployable Website Application/apps/*/dist
Deployable Website Application/packages/*/dist
Deployable Website Application/.env
Deployable Website Application/.env.*
!Deployable Website Application/.env.example
Deployable Website Application/**/*.log
